{"3330330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lunatic Isle", "steam_appid": 3330330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bell tolls on the seventh day, the sky shall be stained crimson, and the island shall awaken</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survived a mysterious storm and woke up stranded on the shores of an isolated island—Moonrunes. The scenery is picturesque, yet fraught with danger. The island is occupied by a fanatical cult that worships an unknowable ancient entity, and you are their latest &quot;sacrifice.&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not your only threat. An ancient curse upon the island causes the moon to turn blood-red every seventh night. The light of the blood moon distorts the earth, amplifies the power of cultists, and summons terrifying monsters that only appear in nightmares from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sole objective is to survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bell tolls on the seventh day, the sky shall be stained crimson, and the island shall awaken</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survived a mysterious storm and woke up stranded on the shores of an isolated island—Moonrunes. The scenery is picturesque, yet fraught with danger. The island is occupied by a fanatical cult that worships an unknowable ancient entity, and you are their latest &quot;sacrifice.&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not your only threat. An ancient curse upon the island causes the moon to turn blood-red every seventh night. The light of the blood moon distorts the earth, amplifies the power of cultists, and summons terrifying monsters that only appear in nightmares from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sole objective is to survive.</p>", "short_description": "Step into *Moonfall Island*, a cursed realm plagued by ancient cults and periodic blood moons. Scavenge for resources, build shelters, explore ruins, and fight alongside friends—but prepare before the bell tolls. When the blood moon rises, the entire world will bare its fangs at you.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330330/beffa5d62ed33d3be0add351fb9ad52d80f133ad/header.jpg?t=1771119252", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330330/118fa5d78ad098d20c7175cba109ff8f0ea16dff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771119252", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330330/118fa5d78ad098d20c7175cba109ff8f0ea16dff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771119252", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10240 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 12700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10240 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["桃巴莫"], "publishers": ["桃巴莫"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-p